----------
scriptunit-fragment
----------

let a = 1000

----------
scriptunit-fragment
----------

var b = 125

----------
scriptunit-fragment
----------

set b = 500
let c = a /! b

----------
expect all three units are entered
----------

| unit | uses | this step | because | holds after |
|------|------|-----------|---------|-------------|
| 1 | - | compiles, runs | new | `a` = 1000 |
| 2 | - | compiles, runs | new | `b` = 500 |
| 3 | reads `a` (1), overwrites `b` (2) | compiles, runs | new | `c` = 2 |

----------
scriptunit-edit 3
----------

set b = 250
let c = a /! b

----------
expect unit 3 is edited to write 250
----------

| unit | uses | this step | because | holds after |
|------|------|-----------|---------|-------------|
| 1 | - | untouched | nothing it uses changed | `a` = 1000 |
| 2 | - | untouched | unit 3 overwrites `b` without reading it | `b` = 250 |
| 3 | reads `a` (1), overwrites `b` (2) | recompiles, runs | edited | `c` = 4 |

