| 2 | - | reruns | rerun: unit 3 overwrote `b` when it last ran, and is retracted | `b` = 125 |
| 3 | reads `a` (1), overwrites `b` (2) | recompile fails | `a` is unbound: unit 1 failed | - |

----------
scriptunit-edit 1
----------

let a = 1000

----------
expect unit 1 is fixed
----------

| unit | uses | this step | because | holds after |
|------|------|-----------|---------|-------------|
| 1 | - | recompiles, runs | edited | `a` = 1000 |
| 2 | - | untouched | unit 3 overwrites `b` without reading it | `b` = 250 |
| 3 | reads `a` (1), overwrites `b` (2) | recompiles, runs | reads `a` from unit 1 | `c` = 4 |
